==English==
===Alternative forms===
*[[⠠⠝]]

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|la}} suffix {{term|-atio|-ātiō|lang=la}}, an alternative form of {{term|-tio|-tiō|lang=la}} (from whence {{term|-tion|lang=en}}).

===Suffix===
{{head|en|suffix|sort=ation}}

# An [[action]] or [[process]] - e.g. [[hibernation]].
# The [[result]] of an action or process - e.g. [[accumulation]].
# A [[state]] or [[quality]] - e.g. [[exhilaration]].

====Related terms====
* [[-tion]]

====Derived terms====
* [[-ification]]
* [[-ization]]/[[-isation]]
* [[-ational]]
{{suffixsee|English}}

